    "CoiStatement": "Vin Shen Ban, James A. Botros, and Christopher J. Madden declare that they have no conflict of interest. H. Hunt Batjer is a co-chair of the National Football League (NFL) Head, Neck, and Spine Committee and is a co-chair of the Texas Institute for Brain Injury and Repair (TIBIR). Human and Animal Rights and Informed Consent This article does not contain any studies with human or animal subjects performed by any of the authors.",
